			"subject": "A feltöltött dokumentumodról döntöttek: {{documentTitle}}",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Döntés a dokumentumodról</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Döntés a dokumentumodról</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Kedves {{recipientNameHtml}}!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A(z) <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> szervezetnél a HR <strong>{{decision}}</strong> a feltöltött dokumentumodat:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Dokumentum:</strong> {{documentTitleHtml}}</p>{{noteHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A dokumentumaidat a Saját dokumentumaim oldalon látod.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Megnyitás</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">Ezt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben dokumentumot töltöttél fel.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Kedves {{recipientName}}!\n\nA(z) {{organizationName}} szervezetnél a HR {{decision}} a feltöltött dokumentumodat: {{documentTitle}}\n{{noteText}}\n\nA dokumentumaidat a Saját dokumentumaim oldalon látod: {{appUrl}}\n\nEzt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben dokumentumot töltöttél fel.\n\n{{appName}}"
		},
		"en": {
			"subject": "A decision was made about your document: {{documentTitle}}",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Decision about your document</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Decision about your document</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Dear {{recipientNameHtml}},</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">HR at <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> <strong>{{decision}}</strong> the document you uploaded:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #18181b;\"><strong>Document:</strong> {{documentTitleHtml}}</p>{{noteHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">You can see your documents on the My documents page.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Open</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">You received this email because you uploaded a document in {{appName}}.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Dear {{recipientName}},\n\nHR at {{organizationName}} {{decision}} the document you uploaded: {{documentTitle}}\n{{noteText}}\n\nYou can see your documents on the My documents page: {{appUrl}}\n\nYou received this email because you uploaded a document in {{appName}}.\n\n{{appName}}"
		}
	}
}
